        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Based on the ludicrously popular animated short and cellphone annoyance, this videogame features the frog-like critter that goes something like, \"A'ding ding ding ding ding d-d-ding-ding ding bing BPHACH! B'omm bdom bom d'dom dom bom d'dom bay bom b'dom bom bom b'b'bom bom booooooohm boohm bom, d'dom bomb ahem bom b'dom bom bom b'dom b'dom d'dhom-d'dhom-d'dhom-b'd'd'd'd'd brrhhhh'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd bhrrem'd'd'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd'd bhrim'd'd'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd bhran'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd'd bhram'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd bom-bom-bom-bom bom Bom Booohm BOOOOHM BOOOOOOOHHHHHHHHM WHEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!!!!!!!\"\n\nCrazy Frog Racer is a high-speed, high-octane wacky racer. Players can either choose to play as 'The Annoying Thing' and D'Ding Ding their way to victory or play as one of eight other characters on 12 racetracks in single and multiplayer racing.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Basado en la animación corta tan absurdamente popular y en la molestia de los teléfonos celulares, este videojuego presenta al bicho parecido a una rana que dice algo como: \"A'ding ding ding ding ding d-d-ding-ding ding bing BPHACH! B'omm bdom bom d'dom dom bom d'dom bay bom b'dom bom bom b'b'bom bom booooooohm boohm bom, d'dom bomb ahem bom b'dom bom bom b'dom b'dom d'dhom-d'dhom-d'dhom-b'd'd'd'd'd brrhhhh'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd bhrrem'd'd'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd'd bhrim'd'd'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd bhran'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'dd'd'd'd bhram'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd'd bom-bom-bom-bom bom Bom Booohm BOOOOHM BOOOOOOOHHHHHHHHM WHEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!!!!!!!\"\n\nCrazy Frog Racer es un juego de carreras de alta velocidad, alta intensidad y muy disparatado. Los jugadores pueden elegir jugar como 'The Annoying Thing' y llegar a la victoria con sus d'ding ding, o jugar como uno de otros ocho personajes en 12 circuitos, en carreras individuales y multijugador.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
